00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:22.970 size:78% position:39% line:92%
((CHRISTIAN CAZARES))

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.070 line:92%
AND I'M CHRISTIAN CAZARES WE'RE

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.170 line:92%
GETTING A CLOSER LOOK AT WHAT

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.180 line:92%
HAPPENED DURING LAST WEEK'S CAR

