00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.890 size:84% position:42% line:92%
CHRISTIAN AND DENISE...

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.090 line:92%
OUR COMMUNITY CONTINUES TO FEEL

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:38.390 line:92%
THE LOSS OF N-H-P TROOPER MICAH

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.960 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
MAY.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.230 line:92%
HE WAS KILLED DURING A PURSUIT

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.090 line:92%
ON THE I-15 LAST TUESDAY -- AND

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:46.600 line:92%
WE'RE GETTING OUR FIRST LOOK

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.600 line:92%
AT POLICE FOOTAGE FROM THAT DAY.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.570 line:92%
NEWLY-RELEASED AERIAL FOOTAGE

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:51.400 line:92%
SHOWS PUBLIC SAFETY OFFICERS

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.900 size:75% position:38% line:92%
CHASING A CARJACKING

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.870 line:92%
SUSPECT, DOUGLAS CLAIBORNE...

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:59.180 line:92%
AS HE DROVE ERRATICALLY ON

00:00:59.180 --> 00:00:59.580 line:92%
THE I-15 AND ALSO ON SURROUNDING

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.910 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
STREETS.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:01.480 line:92%
POLICE SAY CLAIBORNE STOLE

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:02.780 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
SOMEONE'S CAR...

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:03.950 line:92%
AND EVEN USED A FOOT-LONG KNIFE

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:05.850 size:88% position:44% line:92%
TO THERATEN THAT PERSON.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.180 size:75% position:38% line:92%
PAROLE AND PROBATION

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:08.650 line:92%
OFFICERS NOTICED THE STOLEN

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:09.690 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
VEHICLE...

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:10.220 line:92%
AND N-H-P TROOPERS HELPED WITH

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.150 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
THE PURSUIT.

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.160 line:92%
WE'RE TOLD N-H-P TRIED TO USE

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:16.060 line:92%
STOP STICKS SEVERAL TIMES...

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:16.530 line:92%
INCLUDING WHEN TROOPER MAY LAID

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:17.190 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
THEM DOWN.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.160 size:75% position:38% line:92%
POLICE SAY CLAIBORNE

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:20.330 line:92%
INTENTIONALLY HIT TROOPER MAY.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.660 line:92%
N-H-P WAS ABLE TO RAM THE

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.030 line:92%
VEHICLE AND STOP CLAIBORNE.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:23.400 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
