A HANDFUL OF OFFICERS OPENED

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:24.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
FIRE.

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:25.970 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
((

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:26.800 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"OFFICERS

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:27.470 line:92%
OBSERVEDCLAIBORNE GRABBING

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:28.500 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
TROOPER MAY'S GUN.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.270 line:92%
HE WAS STRUCK SEVERAL TIMES AND

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.010 line:92%
SUBSEQUENTLY PRONOUNCED DEAD AT

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:33.810 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
THE SCENE." ))

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:34.750 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
((ORKO MANNA))

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.420 size:84% position:42% line:92%
A METRO HELICOPTER THEN

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.320 line:92%
ARRIVED ON THE I-15 TO TRANSPORT

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:48.930 size:78% position:39% line:92%
TROOPER MAY TO U-M-C.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:49.960 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
UNFORTUNATELY...

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.160 line:92%
TROOPER MAY PASSED AWAY TWO DAYS

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:54.530 size:78% position:39% line:92%
LATER, LAST THURSDAY.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:55.800 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
((ORKO MANNA))

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:56.770 size:78% position:39% line:92%
THERE WILL BE A VIGIL

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:57.070 line:92%
TOMORROW NIGHT TO HONOR TROOPER

00:01:57.070 --> 00:01:58.840 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
MAY.

